# Local Claude skills may carry API keys in their payload files, so skill
# directories stay ignored by default. SKILL.md is documentation and MUST be
# tracked: all 14 skills this repo relies on already are. The blanket rule was
# added 2026-04-13 and, because git ignores never apply to already-tracked
# files, it silently affected only NEW skills - one written after that date
# appeared to be created and then never committed. A secret in a SKILL.md is
# caught by the gitleaks step in pr-checks.yml, not by hiding it from review.
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/*.md
!.claude/skills/*/
.claude/skills/*/*
!.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md

